---
// BeP02LimitRange: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2k">
  <div class="bep2k-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 246" role="img" aria-label="A number line for the limit parameter. The accepted range runs from 1 to 100 with a default of 20. limit=5 sits inside it. limit=10000 is far beyond the ceiling and is refused with 422 before list_cases runs.">
<rect x="60.0" y="96" width="600" height="22" rx="4" class="band" />
<circle cx="84" cy="107" r="6" class="dot" />
<text x="84" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>limit=5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>limit=5</tspan></text>
<line x1="84" y1="78" x2="84" y2="100" class="ln d" />
<circle cx="175" cy="107" r="6" class="dot" />
<text x="175" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>default 20</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mặc định 20</tspan></text>
<line x1="175" y1="78" x2="175" y2="100" class="ln d" />
<text x="60" y="148" text-anchor="start" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>1 (ge=1)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 (ge=1)</tspan></text>
<text x="660" y="148" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>100 (le=100)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>100 (le=100)</tspan></text>
<text x="360" y="148" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>limit may be anything in here</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>limit được phép nằm trong khoảng này</tspan></text>
<text x="700" y="113" text-anchor="middle" class="m">···</text>
<circle cx="810" cy="107" r="7" class="dotr" />
<line x1="810" y1="78" x2="810" y2="99" class="lnr d" />
<text x="810" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="r">limit=10000</text>
<text x="810" y="148" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>beyond the ceiling</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vượt trần</tspan></text>
<rect x="470" y="178" width="410" height="52" rx="8" class="boxr" />
<text x="490" y="202" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>refused with 422 before list_cases runs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bị từ chối bằng 422 trước khi list_cases chạy</tspan></text>
<text x="490" y="221" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>the body says why</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>body nói rõ lý do</tspan></text>
<path d="M 810 156 L 810.0 166.0" class="lnr" /><polygon points="810,172 806.1,163.9 813.9,163.9" class="hdr" />
<text x="20" y="208" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>one signature, no if limit > 100 in the function</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một chữ ký, không có if limit > 100 trong hàm</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The bounds live in the signature: inside 1 to 100 the request runs, outside it gets a 422 and the function never starts.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giới hạn nằm trong chữ ký hàm: trong khoảng 1 đến 100 thì request chạy, ngoài khoảng đó nhận 422 và hàm không hề bắt đầu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2k { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2k-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2k svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2k text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2k .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep2k .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep2k .bb { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2k .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2k .f { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep2k .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2k .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2k .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2k .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2k .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2k .d { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep2k .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2k .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2k .xr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2k .ok { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2k .band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2k .bandr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2k .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2k .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2k figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
